OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and wet start with
OL,6,Fheavy, potentially thundery rain
OL,7,Fmoving across the area. Rain will
OL,8,Fclear to the north by the afternoon
OL,9,Fwith a sunshine and a few showers
OL,10,Ffollowing. feeling warm and humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStarting mostly dry but
OL,13,Fthunderstorms may move into the east
OL,14,Fof the region for a time. These
OL,15,Fshowers move north, leaving clear
OL,16,Fspells for many. Staying mild
OL,17,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
