OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FMostly dry start but showers
OL,6,Fin the west will develop and move
OL,7,Feastwards through the afternoon.
OL,8,FPossible thunder and hail, but staying
OL,9,Fwarm.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAn
OL,12,Funsettled bank holiday weekend with
OL,13,Fshowers and possibly more thunder on
OL,14,Fthe way. Staying warm to start with
OL,15,Fbut turning fresher as winds shift to
OL,16,Fa westerly by Monday.
